'''A Journey of Moments''' (新たな時を刻む旅路, ''Aratana Toki o Kizamu Tabiji'', '''Journey to Carve a New Time''') is the 21st sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 119th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
The difficulty of this sub-chapter mainly comes from the rise of enemy strength. From here on out, almost all enemies (except Sages, [[Metal Hippoe]] and [[Metal Doge]]) will be 1.2x stronger than before, such as [[Sir Metal Seal]] going from the usual 300% to 360%, or even [[Kappy Jr.]] being 120% instead of 100%.

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 2 enemies to Zero Legends:
*[[Puffzerker]]: A [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Mr. Puffington]] from [[Anniversary/12 1/2 Year#Arrival of the Red Ship|Arrival of the Red Ship]]. Has lower base stats, but has a 50% chance to weaken cats to 25% for 5 seconds.
*[[Kappy Jr.]]: A powerful, relatively short-ranged [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy from the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Flow Like the Stream (Merciless)|Bottom of the Swamp]]. Creates a highly damaging level 1 [[Surge Attack|Surge]] between 150 and 750 range on every hit and attacks non-stop, but has a long enough backswing for well-timed [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cats]] to keep him in place.

