==Trivia==
*The [[Zero Legends]] sub-chapters from A Journey of Moments through [[Eden of Evolution]] appear to take place in a flipped and reversed Eurasia with Italy turned into a lake and no Japan or [[wikipedia:Papua (province)|Papua]]. The floating islands on the map may be an homage to [[Floating Continent (Into the Future)|Floating Continent]], since the "final boss" of this part, [[Sage of Selection Darvin]], is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]], and the previous map has a [[Immeasurable Power|whirlpool]] resembling [[The Great Abyss (Into the Future)|The Great Abyss]].
**The omission of Japan is likely because [[The Edge of Spacetime]] through [[Garden of Wilted Thoughts]] already have a Japan-based map.
*Since A Journey of Moments is time-themed and [[Diabrollow]] appears to be based on the Greek Titan [[wikipedia:Cronus|Cronus]], its presence in [[Meeting of Long and Short]] may be a reference to how Cronus is often confused with [[wikipedia:Chronos|Chronos]], the Greek god of time.
*In all versions except [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], [[Tower of the Time Lord]] was [[Puffzerker]]'s first appearance overall, as [[Anniversary/12 1/2 Year#Arrival of the Red Ship|Arrival of the Red Ship]] still hadn't been released outside of Japan by the time A Journey of Moments was added to other versions.
*This is the first sub-chapter to have a difficulty rating of ★12.

